// Project waiver for lint_caliptra and sim_caliptra (listed after upstream's
// .vlt files by scripts/generate_core.py).
//
// With 5.054, Verilator warns SIDEEFFECT on the KV debug-flush assertion: its
// property calls check_kv_slot_debug_value(), which $displays the failing
// dword before returning. The $display is the only side effect, and it only
// reports; it does not change what the property checks.

`verilator_config

// It is the only SIDEEFFECT in the file, so the waiver covers the file.
lint_off -rule SIDEEFFECT -file "*/src/integration/asserts/caliptra_top_sva.sv"
